# pack: service-per-directory
# version: 1
# Independently deployable services that share contracts, never code or databases.
R {services}  dir:services|svc|microservices
R {contracts} dir:contracts|proto|schemas|api-spec|openapi
C C:service-boundaries Services share contracts, never code or storage
K G svc.no-shared-db      {services} a service owns its data store; no other service reads or writes it directly
K G svc.contracts-only    {services} services communicate through {contracts}; no cross-service source imports rule:public-entry:{services}
K G svc.own-build         {services} each service builds and deploys on its own; a change to one does not require redeploying another
K G svc.contracts-stable  {contracts} a contract change is additive or versioned; consumers are never broken by a producer change
E {services} impl C:service-boundaries
